    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low-grade fever and aches; appetite unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat and runny nose; no ear or facial pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough; no breathlessness or wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Nausea on sertraline settled; no vomiting or diarrhea</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood unchanged; no thoughts of death, self-harm, or harm to others</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
